    <div class="c-event-card__body u-pure-white-bg">
        <h3 class="c-event-card__title"><a class="c-event-card__cover-link" href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/whats-on/much-ado-about-nothing/">Much Ado About Nothing</a></h3>
        <div class="c-event-card__details">
            <time class="c-event-card__date"><i class="far fa-calendar"></i> 24 October</time>
                        
        </div>
        <div class="c-event-card__description c-col-txt-area">In sun-soaked Messina, sharp tongues, short tempers and savage gossip collide in an unfiltered rom-com about secrets, status and second chances.</div>
